title: "Claimant standing under asymmetric governance: CPU institutional simulation v0.2.1"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McCallion
    given-names: Brian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-1442-1743"
version: "0.2.1"
abstract: >-
  CPU-only synthetic institutional simulation testing claimant-held contestability
  under asymmetric governance, including control independence, jurisdictional
  reach, shared dependencies, compound attacks, component ablations, mechanism
  decomposition and paired uncertainty analysis.
keywords:
  - AI alignment
  - multi-agent systems
  - contestability
  - institutional AI
  - non-domination
